    {
      "id": "6656176",
      "title": "Using HostListener to Listen to Host Events",
      "lectureOrder": 420,
      "videoOrder": 386,
      "sourceHash": "76e75c1ed727464714d185815865aa1911350638c6cd618338226227a93c0614",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.61,
          "end": 3.87,
          "en": "-: So we saw two examples",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.87,
          "end": 5.13,
          "en": "for directives now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.13,
          "end": 6.09,
          "en": "And the better approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.09,
          "end": 7.56,
          "en": "definitely is a good approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 7.56,
          "end": 9.731,
          "en": "But it's not very interactive, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 9.731,
          "end": 13.62,
          "en": "It always gives us a blue background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.62,
          "end": 15.12,
          "en": "And I want to change this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 15.12,
          "end": 16.89,
          "en": "I only want to style this blue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 16.89,
          "end": 18.33,
          "en": "or give this a blue background,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 18.33,
          "end": 19.71,
          "en": "if I hover over it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 19.71,
          "end": 21.261,
          "en": "And if I move my mouse away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 21.261,
          "end": 23.803,
          "en": "it should go back to transparent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 23.803,
          "end": 25.773,
          "en": "So let's improve the better",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 25.773,
          "end": 27.72,
          "en": "highlight here a bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 27.72,
          "end": 29.55,
          "en": "We need to react to some events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 29.55,
          "end": 31.23,
          "en": "occurring on the element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 31.23,
          "end": 33,
          "en": "the directive sits on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 33,
          "end": 34.14,
          "en": "And a quick and easy way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 34.14,
          "end": 36.03,
          "en": "to do this inside of this directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 36.03,
          "end": 40.5,
          "en": "Is to simply add a new decorator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 40.5,
          "end": 41.37,
          "en": "And this is the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 41.37,
          "end": 43.62,
          "en": "host listener decorator. (keyboard tapping)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 43.62,
          "end": 44.76,
          "en": "Which needs to be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 44.76,
          "end": 46.74,
          "en": "from at angular core. (mouse clicking)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 46.74,
          "end": 50.07,
          "en": "And added to some method we want to execute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 50.07,
          "end": 50.97,
          "en": "So the method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 50.97,
          "end": 54.27,
          "en": "could be mouse over. (keyboard tapping)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 54.27,
          "end": 56.07,
          "en": "Now I will move",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 56.07,
          "end": 58.5,
          "en": "this from the top of the file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 58.5,
          "end": 61.02,
          "en": "below ngOnInit here. (mouse clicking)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 61.02,
          "end": 63.21,
          "en": "So now this can be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 63.21,
          "end": 64.89,
          "en": "whenever some event occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 64.89,
          "end": 66.9,
          "en": "And that event is specified here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 66.9,
          "end": 69.84,
          "en": "as an argument as a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 69.84,
          "end": 71.94,
          "en": "Host listener here takes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 71.94,
          "end": 74.01,
          "en": "the argument name as an input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 74.01,
          "end": 75.03,
          "en": "and that would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 75.03,
          "end": 77.58,
          "en": "mouse enter let's say. (keyboard tapping)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 77.58,
          "end": 79.65,
          "en": "That is one of the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 79.65,
          "end": 81.57,
          "en": "events supported by",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 81.57,
          "end": 82.65,
          "en": "the dom element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 82.65,
          "end": 84.03,
          "en": "this directive sits on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 84.03,
          "end": 85.02,
          "en": "So you have basically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 85.02,
          "end": 86.07,
          "en": "all events available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 86.07,
          "end": 87.12,
          "en": "You could also use with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 87.12,
          "end": 89.31,
          "en": "event binding before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 89.31,
          "end": 91.05,
          "en": "So that's my host listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 91.05,
          "end": 92.94,
          "en": "targeting this event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 92.94,
          "end": 94.2,
          "en": "And we could also receive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 94.2,
          "end": 95.88,
          "en": "the event data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 95.88,
          "end": 98.13,
          "en": "So event data of type event (Keyboard tapping)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 98.13,
          "end": 99.87,
          "en": "would be passed to us here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 99.87,
          "end": 100.97999999999999,
          "en": "So that works. (mouse clicking)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 100.97999999999999,
          "end": 101.813,
          "en": "You can also listen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 101.813,
          "end": 102.72,
          "en": "to custom events here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 102.72,
          "end": 103.97999999999999,
          "en": "and retrieve that data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 103.97999999999999,
          "end": 105.81,
          "en": "So that's just like the method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 105.81,
          "end": 107.035,
          "en": "you execute when you add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 107.035,
          "end": 108.50999999999999,
          "en": "a click listener or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 108.50999999999999,
          "end": 109.74000000000001,
          "en": "whatever your event is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 109.74000000000001,
          "end": 111.93,
          "en": "And then pass the method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 111.93,
          "end": 113.31,
          "en": "between the quotation marks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 113.31,
          "end": 114.87,
          "en": "So that's happening here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 114.87,
          "end": 115.83,
          "en": "Host listener's just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 115.83,
          "end": 117.064,
          "en": "a convenient way of listening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 117.064,
          "end": 119.85,
          "en": "to events on that element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 119.85,
          "end": 121.59,
          "en": "So with that we listen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 121.59,
          "end": 122.61,
          "en": "to the mouse entry event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
